---
layout: base.njk
title: 简报归档
description: 按日期排列的美国 AI 产业链融资风险周报。
permalink: /briefs/
---
<h1>简报归档</h1>
<p class="lede">一期一个文件。新增一周，把一篇 Markdown 放到 <code>src/briefs/</code>。</p>
<ol class="archive">
  {% for item in collections.brief | newestFirst %}
    <li>
      <p class="kicker">{{ item.date | ymd }}</p>
      <h2><a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a></h2>
      <p>{{ item.data.summary }}</p>
      {% if item.data.judgments %}
        <ul class="pill-row">
          {% for judgment in item.data.judgments %}
            <li><span class="pill tone-{{ judgment.tone }}">{{ judgment.heading }} · {{ judgment.label }}</span></li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      {% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ol>
